    <item>
      <title>Ep. 1 — Grand Re-Opening (Mostly)</title>
      <link>https://kinbondjoy.pw/stories/jungle-park.html</link>
      <description>Grand re-opening day at the jungle&#x27;s only theme park! Poison Honey counts everything he&#x27;s ever been stuck to, Taro counts wrong on purpose, and the RattleSticks prove they can NOT count. Learning layer: counting 1-10.</description>
      <itunes:image href="https://kinbondjoy.pw/audio/jungle-park/icons/jungle-park-ep01-icon.png"/>
