    <item>
      <title>Ep. 2 — The Off-Switch</title>
      <link>https://kinbondjoy.pw/stories/jungle-park.html</link>
      <description>Dr. Gok installs an off-switch on the Vine rollercoaster with a countdown guarded by three monsters who can&#x27;t count. Poison Honey teaches them to count down and saves the park (and the snacks). Learning layer: counting down from 10 to 1.</description>
      <itunes:image href="https://kinbondjoy.pw/audio/jungle-park/icons/jungle-park-ep02-icon.png"/>
      <enclosure url="https://kinbondjoy.pw/audio/jungle-park/jungle-park-ep02-the-off-switch.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" length="9551455"/>
