    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Ep. 3 — Counting Kevin</title>
      <link>https://kinbondjoy.pw/stories/jungle-park.html</link>
      <description>Who is Kevin? The park&#x27;s favorite elephant has no partner for the two-by-two march, until a surprise arrives from the sky. Learning layer: counting by 2s and counting pairs.</description>
      <itunes:image href="https://kinbondjoy.pw/audio/jungle-park/icons/jungle-park-ep03-icon.png"/>
      <enclosure url="https://kinbondjoy.pw/audio/jungle-park/jungle-park-ep03-counting-kevin.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" length="8209179"/>
