    <item>
      <title>Ep. 4 — The Great Mango Race</title>
      <link>https://kinbondjoy.pw/stories/jungle-park.html</link>
      <description>Four teams race for mangoes, but Dr. Gok&#x27;s mango cannon SUBTRACTS! Adding wins the day, and the fastest snail finishes first and last. Learning layer: simple adding (2+2, 3+2).</description>
      <itunes:image href="https://kinbondjoy.pw/audio/jungle-park/icons/jungle-park-ep04-icon.png"/>
      <enclosure url="https://kinbondjoy.pw/audio/jungle-park/jungle-park-ep04-the-great-mango-race.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" length="8992852"/>
