    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Ep. 5 — The Twenty-Mango Problem</title>
      <link>https://kinbondjoy.pw/stories/jungle-park.html</link>
      <description>The Puma Inspector is coming at noon, and the park needs twenty things done right. The RattleSticks count by fives to save the day. Learning layer: counting by 5s to 20.</description>
      <itunes:image href="https://kinbondjoy.pw/audio/jungle-park/icons/jungle-park-ep05-icon.png"/>
