    <item>
      <title>Ep. 6 — The RattleStick Talent Show</title>
      <link>https://kinbondjoy.pw/stories/jungle-park.html</link>
      <description>The first-ever Jungle Park talent show! Cocal&#x27;s one-snail play, Axie&#x27;s thirty backflips, and the counting monsters steal the night. Learning layer: counting by 10s to 30.</description>
