    <item>
      <title>Ep. 7 — The Sharing Snarl</title>
      <link>https://kinbondjoy.pw/stories/jungle-park.html</link>
      <description>One mango, two hungry animals, and Judge Hodo&#x27;s beach-towel court rules: SHARE! The RattleSticks learn what a half is (and eat a little evidence). Learning layer: fair sharing and halves.</description>
      <itunes:image href="https://kinbondjoy.pw/audio/jungle-park/icons/jungle-park-ep07-icon.png"/>
