    <item>
      <title>Ep. 8 — Hodo Counts to One Hundred</title>
      <link>https://kinbondjoy.pw/stories/jungle-park.html</link>
      <description>Hodo the toucan, famously terrible at counting, attempts to count all the way to ONE HUNDRED live in front of the whole park. Learning layer: counting to 100 by 10s.</description>
